{"reviewId": "380402079_80S0iGG0S", "review": {"abstract": "2016年之后不要再做激进式投资，不要使自己在过去6年创造的财富被消灭在泡沫中。我有一句著名的话，“人生发财靠康波”，现在在座的30岁以下的人，你们人生中第一次发财的机会要过5年才能来临，", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "15 演讲实录：宿命与反抗", "chapterUid": 20, "content": "他说的是正确的，2015年630出现了5178，随后股市开始下跌，一直跌到2018年的低点之后开始有好转，2020年到202一年开启了一轮小牛市，所以他说，2016年之后不要做投资，至少不要冒险，至少五年之后，才会有一次机会。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "6608-6702", "createTime": 1749788334, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "380402079_80S0iGG0S", "userVid": 380402079, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 20, "chapterTitle": "15 演讲实录：宿命与反抗", "author": {"userVid": 380402079, "name": "@雁菁💞", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-YP88sMnDO5fc6f~Xb7tXUf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "@雁菁💞", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "文字中谋心，阅读中谋趣，烟火中谋生。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "人丑就要多读书，腹有诗书气自华。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 13, "likes": [{"userVid": 31931416, "name": "学龄前儿童", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/fwyBE4pxjzokB9HW61jrSO5aPVY95ibfgh2OPBvyrwXVMuY27LO3Qu8OaPk7L0jbw7wcp2Xxvzv0g1G16gkmCUtibkxACdlfAXf7zgbI8zZ4Q/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "学龄前儿童", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": 